          "docs": "Updates a supplement by clearing all previously added field values. Supplement name, key, and indexes will remain in the Cordial database and the supplement can be updated again with new values for the fields.\n\nThe supplement is defined by its unique `key` value. For example, /supplements/cars/clear would clear the field values in the supplement with a key of <b>cars</b>."
