          "docs": "Deletes a supplement record and its data from the specified supplement collection. The supplement is defined by its unique `key` value and the supplement record is defined by its unique `id` value.\n\nFor example, /supplements/cars/records/33415 would remove the record with the id value <b>33415</b> from the <b>cars</b> supplement collection."
