          "docs": "Creates a supplement record import job using the JSON body information. The import file must contain an `id` field that uniquely identifies each supplement data record. By default, importing records with an `id` that already exists will overwrite the existing data record.\n\nColumn headers can include one or more indexed fields along with any other optional non-indexed fields of your choosing.\n\nIf needed, an optional email confirmation can be sent to the specified email address when the job is don"
